        <mxCell id="features" value="Key Features:&#xa;• User profiles &amp; authentication&#xa;• Post creation (text/media)&#xa;• News feed (personalized)&#xa;• Follow/unfollow users&#xa;• Like, comment, share&#xa;• Real-time notifications&#xa;• Direct messaging&#xa;• Search (users, posts, hashtags)&#xa;• Trending topics&#xa;• Stories (24hr content)&#xa;• Groups &amp; communities" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
